WEBVTT

00:01:57.966 --> 00:01:59.466
Man!

00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:04.773
What the heck...
is happening here?!

00:02:05.233 --> 00:02:06.473
Just a minute!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.130
Why does it have to be like this?!

00:02:08.266 --> 00:02:09.926
This isn't fair!

00:02:09.966 --> 00:02:11.366
Go home if you've got a problem!

00:02:11.566 --> 00:02:13.026
We don't need a useless person!

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:16.066
Shut up! I'm not asking you!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.000
Don't get so upset.

00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:22.073
We're having you carry the stuff
to improve your basic physical strength.

00:02:22.533 --> 00:02:24.333
It's not that we're being mean.

00:02:24.633 --> 00:02:26.603
Oh really?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.770
Then I've got to show off a bit!

00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:33.433
Let's do this!

00:02:33.466 --> 00:02:35.596
Simple as always.

00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:43.533
What a moron.

00:02:43.933 --> 00:02:45.573
Darn it.

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:51.303
SHU AND JIRO

00:03:00.933 --> 00:03:02.073
Hey Zola.

00:03:03.633 --> 00:03:06.473
Teach me how to make
my Shadow appear already!

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.500
Impossible.

00:03:08.433 --> 00:03:10.833
There are so many things
you still have to do.

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:18.203
You have to train your body,
spirit and skills to control your Shadow.

00:03:18.566 --> 00:03:19.566
I'll do that, too!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.570
But show me how to get my Shadow
to appear along with that!

00:03:23.266 --> 00:03:23.926
Why?

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:28.033
I can't stand him looking
so full of himself.

00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:31.566
Besides, I don't wanna be a burden!

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:33.333
Very well.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:36.500
However, you will do as I say!

00:03:36.766 --> 00:03:39.996
Sure! I'll do anything!

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:56.303
First, you have to learn how
to sense the Shadow.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.300
Right! Tell me.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.900
You must know that
the Shadow is a part of you.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.470
But at the same time,
it's also separate from you.

00:04:06.066 --> 00:04:08.766
It's difficult to explain,
but calling forth your Shadow

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.670
should feel as if you're peeling off
a part of yourself,

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.130
kind of like shedding a layer of skin.

00:04:15.733 --> 00:04:16.773
What's wrong?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.730
Well, I have no clue
what you're saying.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.370
Then relax your body and

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:26.800
try speaking to your Shadow
inside your mind.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.270
Speak to the Shadow...

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:33.873
That's right.
At least that's the way I do it.

00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:38.196
You've called forth your Shadow before.

00:04:38.433 --> 00:04:40.573
Try to recall what it felt like then.

00:04:40.966 --> 00:04:41.966
Got it!

00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:45.796
Relax my body.

00:04:46.366 --> 00:04:49.126
Try speaking to the Shadow
in my mind.

00:04:51.266 --> 00:04:52.266
Speak to the Shadow.

00:05:04.566 --> 00:05:07.666
Come out... Shadow!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.930
I told you, in your mind.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.500
Damn it.

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:23.273
I knew it was too soon.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.700
Train yourself first and
take things slowly.

00:05:27.433 --> 00:05:30.473
Jiro! Train with Shu for a while.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.330
Just a minute. Why me?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.930
Yeah, why him?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:40.670
If you're afraid to lose,
then you don't have to.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.300
- I'm not afraid!
- I'm not afraid!

00:05:43.533 --> 00:05:45.273
Then it's settled.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.770
I wonder if it'll be okay...

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.170
As for the unit dispatched
to Talta Village,

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.230
80% of their force weapons
have been destroyed.

00:06:06.633 --> 00:06:09.433
For all practical purposes,
the unit is out of commission.

00:06:10.066 --> 00:06:12.626
We've received information that

00:06:12.666 --> 00:06:15.566
the enemy forces have headed
in a northeast direction.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.200
This concludes the report.

00:06:19.633 --> 00:06:20.703
Good work.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.730
What do you think, Dolsk?

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:30.470
An entire Grankingdom Army squadron
was destroyed in one night.

00:06:31.133 --> 00:06:33.033
It's no trifling matter.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.970
No matter how wimpy that
unit might've been,

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.300
there was something with
the power to destroy them.

00:06:43.466 --> 00:06:44.666
Shadows?

00:06:46.266 --> 00:06:49.196
We won't know until we see
for ourselves.

00:06:49.966 --> 00:06:52.896
But it's becoming quite interesting.

00:06:53.233 --> 00:06:55.573
I see. Then this is perfect.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.870
We've received a direct command
from Lord Nene.

00:06:59.166 --> 00:07:01.896
I leave this mission to you.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:03.800
Roger.

00:07:21.433 --> 00:07:22.433
We're finished.

00:07:22.566 --> 00:07:24.396
Huh? R-Right.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.070
We're moving on, Shu.

00:07:29.266 --> 00:07:30.696
R-Right...

00:07:42.466 --> 00:07:43.496
Something wrong?

00:07:43.966 --> 00:07:46.126
N-Nothing...

00:07:53.433 --> 00:07:55.133
No way...

00:07:57.533 --> 00:07:59.473
...I'm gonna lose...

00:08:02.066 --> 00:08:03.766
...to you!

00:08:20.866 --> 00:08:21.866
You little!

00:08:40.266 --> 00:08:41.496
Alright, let's go.

00:08:41.933 --> 00:08:42.603
Right!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.530
Shu?

00:08:47.566 --> 00:08:49.066
Damn it.

00:08:49.533 --> 00:08:51.003
You've got a long way to go.

00:08:57.633 --> 00:08:58.303
Begin.

00:09:03.666 --> 00:09:05.196
Come out, Shadow!

00:09:16.033 --> 00:09:17.733
Don't get discouraged.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.600
It takes time for anybody to
release their Shadows.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.100
Hey, wimp!

00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:25.196
Time for more workouts.
Let's go!

00:09:26.066 --> 00:09:27.166
That's low!

00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:28.896
Wait! Hey!

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.900
I wonder if it was a fluke before...

00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:39.303
Why did you come along?

00:09:39.733 --> 00:09:40.403
Huh?

00:09:41.166 --> 00:09:43.096
This journey is dangerous.

00:09:43.566 --> 00:09:44.966
You left your village
and your family.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.500
You must've had a good reason
for coming along with Shu.

00:09:52.866 --> 00:09:54.666
I was just worried about him.

00:09:56.233 --> 00:09:59.103
Plus there was so much stuff
happening all at once!

00:09:59.833 --> 00:10:02.373
Before I knew it,
I found myself along for the ride!

00:10:03.333 --> 00:10:06.373
Shu is a goof,
so I couldn't leave him.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.600
I see... You're a kind person.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.800
It's not like that!

00:10:13.366 --> 00:10:14.766
There's no need to deny it.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:19.600
That kindness will someday
become your strength.

00:10:19.733 --> 00:10:21.473
Uh-huh...

00:10:22.433 --> 00:10:25.073
Why do you continue your journey?

00:10:28.633 --> 00:10:33.273
Let's just say...to accomplish my goal.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:36.600
Goal?

00:10:46.033 --> 00:10:48.233
Racing in the forest is my expertise!

00:10:48.266 --> 00:10:50.226
There's no way I will lose to you!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:10:59.970
You goof...

00:11:00.833 --> 00:11:01.833
Let me tell you something.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:04.600
Just being able to run around
in the woods

00:11:04.633 --> 00:11:07.373
won't win you any battles
with Shadows.

00:11:08.133 --> 00:11:10.603
You won't be able to fight
against enemy Shadows

00:11:10.633 --> 00:11:12.433
until you can release
your Shadow and use it.

00:11:12.566 --> 00:11:14.266
I know that!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.900
Hey! Jiro!
Let me tell you one thing!

00:11:18.066 --> 00:11:20.726
I will never lose to you!

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.130
You always do though...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.170
It seems you're ready.

00:11:53.366 --> 00:11:54.026
Always...

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:57.370
Bring it!

00:11:57.766 --> 00:11:58.896
Minotaur!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.400
Yeah!

00:12:08.866 --> 00:12:10.496
One more shot.

00:12:12.733 --> 00:12:13.403
Now!

00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:39.003
Whoops...

00:12:40.033 --> 00:12:41.033
Game over.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.270
I know you want to build up power.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.500
But doing so is like asking
to be attacked.

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:52.900
An opening is created when you try
to execute a powerful technique.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.830
If you don't fix that,

00:12:55.866 --> 00:12:58.466
you'll never have a weapon that can
take down an opponent with one shot.

00:12:58.566 --> 00:13:00.066
I know that!

00:13:00.266 --> 00:13:04.196
An enemy isn't going to
help you win.

00:13:04.966 --> 00:13:06.066
Keep up your training.

00:13:08.466 --> 00:13:09.466
W-Wow...

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:23.670
Their rivalry seems to
be working out...

00:13:24.133 --> 00:13:27.673
But still, even if Shu can keep up
with Jiro physically,

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:31.270
it won't be anytime soon that
he is proficient with his Shadow.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:35.600
They won't stay quiet forever.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.630
We need to hurry.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:52.870
Kluke, what are you doing?

00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:55.296
Well, I can't just be
some tagalong kid.

00:13:55.833 --> 00:13:57.533
I've got to find some way
to be useful!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.070
Cooking?

00:13:59.133 --> 00:14:00.333
Yup, cooking.

00:14:01.466 --> 00:14:03.626
As I recall, her cooking is...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.300
Here, eat up.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.130
Wow, thanks.

00:14:12.733 --> 00:14:14.033
Yummy?

00:14:17.366 --> 00:14:18.426
Bon appÃ©tit.

00:14:18.466 --> 00:14:19.126
Huh?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.030
I'm tired, so I'm going to take
a nap over there!

00:14:25.533 --> 00:14:26.603
Oh, Jiro.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.800
Cooking?

00:14:28.233 --> 00:14:30.403
You don't have to
make anything too fancy.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.700
Why not?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.800
You can't make anything
good if you don't spend some time.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:37.900
We don't know when
we'll be attacked.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:40.700
We don't want it to go to waste.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:45.070
Oh, I see. Okay.
I'll remember that next time.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.070
Okay.

00:14:47.366 --> 00:14:50.296
I'll give her food to you...

00:14:50.333 --> 00:14:52.973
Say, why are you on this journey?

00:14:54.166 --> 00:14:55.526
Why do you ask?

00:14:56.133 --> 00:15:00.773
Zola asked me earlier,
so I was wondering about you.

00:15:03.933 --> 00:15:05.003
You want to hear why?

00:15:06.066 --> 00:15:07.066
Revenge.

00:15:07.733 --> 00:15:08.733
Revenge?

00:15:09.833 --> 00:15:13.103
I'm on this journey to defeat Nene.

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.900
That's it.

00:15:18.766 --> 00:15:19.426
We have company.

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.500
You handle this, Jiro.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:24.470
What?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.230
A-An enemy?!

00:15:26.266 --> 00:15:28.966
You're in the way!
Just go hide somewhere!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.800
What?! Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:38.966 --> 00:15:41.466
Oh, you're just kids.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.600
Well, whatever...

00:15:45.033 --> 00:15:47.173
I'll still fight you.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.900
Darn it!

00:15:49.066 --> 00:15:50.866
W-What happened?

00:15:52.833 --> 00:15:53.833
My food!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.830
The food I went to all
the trouble of making!

00:15:57.866 --> 00:16:01.066
Hello. My name is Dolsk.

00:16:01.666 --> 00:16:05.466
And this is my Shadow who
will defeat you guys!

00:16:09.466 --> 00:16:10.496
Ogre!

00:16:11.933 --> 00:16:13.573
Come out! Minotaur!

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:21.070
So you had a Shadow after all.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.100
Otherwise, it wouldn't be any fun.

00:16:23.266 --> 00:16:24.796
Wouldn't be any fun?

00:16:25.166 --> 00:16:30.866
That's right.
Fun is better than boring, right?

00:16:32.066 --> 00:16:34.296
This enemy's got a pretty good
sense of humor.

00:16:34.733 --> 00:16:35.833
I like it.

00:16:35.933 --> 00:16:39.103
Enough with all the chatter!
Let's go, Minotaur!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.500
Got it!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:44.170
What?!

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:48.400
Oh... It seems your Shadow
boasts of strength.

00:16:49.733 --> 00:16:54.433
But you see,
we've got more strength!

00:17:01.433 --> 00:17:03.303
Man, I can't stand this.

00:17:03.333 --> 00:17:06.903
I won't last if it's gonna be like this
every time you summon me!

00:17:07.133 --> 00:17:08.503
Stop complaining. Let's do it!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.300
Me too!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.070
Why doesn't it work?

00:17:24.333 --> 00:17:25.333
There!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.270
So there's one more Shadow Wielder?

00:17:37.466 --> 00:17:39.966
Stay calm!
Study your opponent!

00:17:40.333 --> 00:17:42.073
You don't have to tell me that!

00:17:42.166 --> 00:17:43.166
Stay out of it!

00:17:44.466 --> 00:17:45.796
This isn't anything special.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.500
Waves of Rage!

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:48.903
You sure, Jiro?

00:17:48.933 --> 00:17:50.973
Shut up. Let's settle this!

00:17:55.866 --> 00:17:56.526
Uh-oh!

00:18:00.766 --> 00:18:03.426
So inexperienced!
You left yourself wide open!

00:18:05.333 --> 00:18:06.503
I told you.

00:18:06.533 --> 00:18:07.533
Shut up.

00:18:08.966 --> 00:18:14.296
You're just a kid after all.
But don't hold back, Ogre!

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.400
Damn. All I can do is watch?

00:18:23.033 --> 00:18:23.703
Shu...

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.730
What?

00:18:25.766 --> 00:18:27.966
Make that Shadow appear right now.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:28.670
Huh?

00:18:29.066 --> 00:18:32.596
I'm telling you to avenge my food!

00:18:32.833 --> 00:18:34.373
Why are you so mad?!

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:37.730
- Come back here, Shu!
- I mean, don't get mad at me!

00:18:40.366 --> 00:18:44.666
Just quit all your stalling.
Make that Shadow appear now!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.300
Owww...

00:18:54.033 --> 00:18:54.703
Huh?

00:18:55.866 --> 00:18:56.526
What's that?

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.470
What?!

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:58.270
It can't be!

00:18:59.133 --> 00:19:00.673
It appeared!

00:19:06.666 --> 00:19:09.826
He released his Blue Dragon
in this short period of time...

00:19:10.933 --> 00:19:11.603
Shu...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.300
Power! Give me power!

00:19:19.333 --> 00:19:21.233
Stop moving on your own!

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.400
It seems he doesn't know
how to control it yet.

00:19:24.766 --> 00:19:26.596
He got...his Shadow to appear...

00:19:27.533 --> 00:19:28.673
A jerk like that?!

00:19:34.433 --> 00:19:36.033
Nice, blue one!

00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:43.933
Cut it out!

00:19:45.333 --> 00:19:48.673
Damn that Shu, dragging us down...

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:49.800
What's the plan?

00:19:50.366 --> 00:19:52.726
It's gotten tougher to fight
than before!

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:53.970
Jiro!

00:19:55.033 --> 00:19:56.733
Take Kluke and go to the rear!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.400
Leave the rest to me!

00:20:00.133 --> 00:20:01.703
I told you to stay out of it!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:06.400
Stop acting tough!
What can we do in this situation?

00:20:06.433 --> 00:20:09.433
I can make it work!
I'm not like Shu!

00:20:09.466 --> 00:20:15.326
How? Like Zola said,
the enemy isn't gonna help us.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.100
Waves of Rage.

00:20:17.133 --> 00:20:18.273
Oh, brother.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:22.130
I'm telling you, it's useless!

00:20:26.833 --> 00:20:28.133
I'm just getting started!

00:20:41.866 --> 00:20:46.226
Enough already.
I'm reaching my limit!

00:20:46.266 --> 00:20:47.596
Shall we?

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:56.330
You're sure pesky!
I'll end this right now!

00:20:58.133 --> 00:20:59.133
He fell for it!

00:20:59.166 --> 00:20:59.796
What?!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.670
Not bad. So he turned his weakness
into strength.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:23.500
Hey you! You said something
about strength earlier...

00:21:24.533 --> 00:21:28.373
I'll show you my strength!

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.800
Waves of Rage!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:45.970
This can't be! Losing in strength...

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:49.870
Yes!

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:54.730
Somebody stop him!

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:04.370
You turned a crisis into opportunity
to defeat the enemy.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:06.370
It worked out this time, butâ€”

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:07.400
I know!

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:10.200
I don't intend on fighting like this.

00:22:10.233 --> 00:22:11.673
It accumulates too much damage.

00:22:14.766 --> 00:22:18.326
At any rate, what is he?

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.370
Does he have what it takes, or...

00:22:24.766 --> 00:22:25.766
What's that?!

00:22:27.233 --> 00:22:29.303
It's a Grankingdom battleship!

00:24:21.166 --> 00:24:22.666
A Shadow Wielder Marumaro
suddenly appears

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:23.970
and attacks Shu and his friends.

00:24:24.166 --> 00:24:27.696
His curse has made
everyone become Marumaro.

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:29.800
What are we gonna do, maro!

00:24:29.833 --> 00:24:32.673
No, maro! I don't wanna stay
in this stuffed-animal like body!

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:34.670
My head and belly are
the same size, maro!

00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:36.300
My eyes are only a single line, maro.

00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:39.500
Next on Blue Dragon:
"Underwear Is the Trump Card"
